<title>UK: Export Development Corp sets 100 mln stg 3-yr bond.</title>
<headline>Export Development Corp sets 100 mln stg 3-yr bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Nomura.</p>
<p> BORROWER   EXPORT DEVELOPMENT CORP</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN STG   COUPON     6.55	MATURITY    17.APR.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.0     PAY DATE    17.APR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.375     LISTING    NONE	PAY FREQ    SEMI-ANN</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AA2/AA+   DENOMS (K) FIVE	SALE LIMITS *</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    **	  HOME CTRY  CANADA    TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.50	SELL CONC  0.875     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES     *CUSTOMARY EDC SALES</p>
<p>	    **ONTARIO/CANADA</p>
<p>		ISSUED OFF DEBT ISSUANCE PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
